msgid ""
"The April newsletter has been sent. It's full of great new articles like "
"\"Kubernetes Native Java with Quarkus\" by Jason Greene, John Clingan and "
"Eric Deandrea. Others include:Develop and Deploy Cloud Native Java "
"Applications at Supersonic speed, Build a REST API from the ground up with "
"Quarkus 2.0, Building Databases on Kubernetes with Quarkus, Insights on "
"Vaadin with Quarkus, Quarkus Tools for Visual Studio Code - 1.10.0 release, "
"Qute Templating Engine Support - Now Available for Quarkus Tools for Visual "
"Studio Code, and Riding Camel Quarkus: effortless APIs. You will also see "
"the lastest Quarkus Insights episodes and upcoming Quarkus attended events."
msgstr ""

msgid "Check out https://quarkus.io/newsletter/19/[Newsletter #19]!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Want to get newsletters in your inbox? https://quarkus.io/newsletter[Sign up "
"for the newsletter] using the on page form."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We've also included the list of the newest found online stories. Give it a "
"read and if you feel something is missing or have an article coming out for "
"future Quarkus Newsletter install the https://github.com/quarkusio/"
"url2quarkuspub[bookmarklet] on your laptop and phone to easily submit a "
"story. If you prefer the manual way please https://github.com/quarkusio/"
"quarkusio.github.io/issues[open an issue] with a short description and a url."
""
msgstr ""
